Description: unofficial launcher for the LFS new-graphics public test
 Live for Speed Linux verifies and installs untouched official Live for Speed
 downloads into a private Wine prefix. The game, Wine, and DXVK payloads are
 not included in this package and are fetched only after an explicit user
 command.
 .
 Live for Speed 0.8C20 is a public test and is not represented as stable.
 Live for Speed is proprietary software; its terms apply separately.
